---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../../components/CodeBlock.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Webhooks" activeNav="/guides/webhooks">
  <h1>Outbound Webhooks</h1>
  <p>
    Webhook endpoints receive HTTP POST requests when events occur in your team.
    Each delivery is signed with HMAC-SHA256 and includes retry logic.
  </p>

  <h2>Creating an endpoint</h2>
  <CodeBlock lang="bash" code={`curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/acme/webhooks \\
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY' \\
  -H 'Accept: application/json' \\
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\
  -d '{
    "name": "Production failures",
    "url": "https://automation.example.com/app-manager",
    "events": ["build.completed", "artifact.created"],
    "filters": {
      "mobile_app_ids": ["019f..."],
      "tags": ["release", "customer-a"],
      "build_statuses": ["failed"],
      "profile_types": ["production"]
    }
  }'`} />

  <p>
    The <code>secret</code> is returned only in the creation response.
    Save it immediately — it cannot be retrieved later. Use <strong>Rotate secret</strong> to get a new one.
  </p>

  <h2>Subscribable events</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Event</th><th>Description</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>mobile_app.created</code></td><td>Application created</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>mobile_app.updated</code></td><td>Application updated</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>mobile_app.deleted</code></td><td>Application deleted</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>app_identifier.created</code></td><td>Identifier created</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>app_identifier.updated</code></td><td>Identifier updated</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>app_identifier.deleted</code></td><td>Identifier deleted</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>credential.created</code></td><td>Credential created</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>credential.updated</code></td><td>Credential updated</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>credential.deleted</code></td><td>Credential deleted</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>build.created</code></td><td>Build created</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>build.started</code></td><td>Build started</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>build.cancel_requested</code></td><td>Build cancellation requested</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>build.completed</code></td><td>Build completed</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>artifact.created</code></td><td>Build artifact uploaded</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>artifact.deleted</code></td><td>Build artifact deleted</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>team.invitation.created</code></td><td>Team invitation created</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>team.invitation.accepted</code></td><td>Team invitation accepted</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>team.invitation.revoked</code></td><td>Team invitation revoked</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>team.member.role_changed</code></td><td>Team member role changed</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>team.member.removed</code></td><td>Team member removed</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Filtering</h2>
  <p>
    Optional <code>filters</code> narrow delivery to specific apps, tags, build statuses, or profile types.
    Empty filter groups don't restrict delivery. Non-empty groups are joined with AND; values within a group are joined with OR.
  </p>

  <CodeBlock lang="json" code={`{
  "filters": {
    "mobile_app_ids": ["019f..."],
    "tags": ["release"],
    "build_statuses": ["failed"],
    "profile_types": ["production"]
  }
}`} />

  <h2>Request verification</h2>
  <p>Each delivery includes these headers:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Header</th><th>Description</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>X-App-Manager-Event</code></td><td>Event type</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>X-App-Manager-Delivery</code></td><td>Delivery ID</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>X-App-Manager-Timestamp</code></td><td>Unix timestamp</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>X-App-Manager-Signature</code></td><td>HMAC-SHA256 signature</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>The <code>v1</code> signature is computed as:</p>
  <CodeBlock lang="text" code={`HMAC-SHA256({timestamp}.{raw_body}, {signing_secret})`} />

  <p>
    Always verify the timestamp and signature before parsing the JSON body.
    Handle deliveries idempotently — retries preserve the delivery ID.
  </p>

  <h2>Testing</h2>
  <p>
    Use the <strong>Test</strong> endpoint to queue a test delivery. It is always sent
    regardless of subscriptions and filters.
  </p>
  <CodeBlock lang="bash" code={`curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/acme/webhooks/ENDPOINT_ID/test \\
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY'`} />

  <h2>Redelivery</h2>
  <p>
    Manual redelivery creates a new delivery record linked to the original via <code>redelivery_of_id</code>.
  </p>
  <CodeBlock lang="bash" code={`curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/acme/webhooks/ENDPOINT_ID/deliveries/DELIVERY_ID/redeliver \\
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY'`} />
</DocsLayout>
